5. plugins/stackgen/stacks/app-framework/swiftui/skills/ux-gate/SKILL.md:61 — step 3 groups by destination platform; mobile, tablet and auto all map to iOS Simulator, so tablet and CarPlay screens run on the pinned iPhone and can be reported ok under their own viewport line, contradicting step 1's "a golden rendered at another size is not evidence for this one".

